    <edge source="n230" target="n187">
      <data key="e_repost_uri">at://did:plc:upddf5jo7vlndgp7voshjiav/app.bsky.feed.post/3lnfyzxgqvk2j</data>
      <data key="e_created_at">2025-04-22</data>
      <data key="e_like_count">3</data>
      <data key="e_reply_count">0</data>
      <data key="e_bookmark_count">0</data>
      <data key="e_repost_count">1</data>
      <data key="e_text">A HUGE thank- you to Jueyj Halligan and her brother Chris Halligan who completed the Pettitts SuperValu Wexford 10Km run and raised €1326 in aid of Mental Health Ireland. &quot;Let&apos;s keep talking Lads!&apos; #MentalHealth #SpeirGorm</data>
      <data key="e_reposts_received">1</data>
      <data key="e_edgeStarts">2025-04-22</data>
      <data key="e_edgeEnds">2025-04-22</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="n256" target="n250">
      <data key="e_repost_uri">at://did:plc:uwji4l3wzsygaxduowluqmgr/app.bsky.feed.post/3ls32t2vfhs2y</data>
      <data key="e_created_at">2025-06-20</data>
      <data key="e_like_count">53</data>
      <data key="e_reply_count">4</data>
      <data key="e_bookmark_count">0</data>
      <data key="e_repost_count">8</data>
      <data key="e_text">I am so glad I got this wonderful pie3of art by @ianfay.bsky.social for @shiminay.bsky.social

It makes him giggle and smile a lot and I get to see his stunning dimples.

#Art #speirgorm #3dprint #tayto</data>
